{
  "name": "admin_propose_changes",
  "description": "申请后台变更，必须等待用户审批后平台才写入。先读后改，每个改动的售价提供 pricing_basis；回滚只传 revert_of。",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "reason": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "revert_of": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "items": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 50,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "target",
            "key",
            "patch"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "target": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "model",
                "pricing_settings",
                "plugin",
                "channel",
                "model_create",
                "user",
                "register_settings",
                "smtp_settings",
                "storage",
                "image_processor"
              ]
            },
            "key": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "base_sha256": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "patch": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "管理资源 patch 用 {action, ...操作字段}：user 的 action=status(status,cancel_active?)/limit(max_active_tasks，可为 null)/credits(mode=add|sub|set,amount,note)/role(role)；register_settings 的 update 可改 register_enabled/initial_credits/default_max_active_tasks/queue_multiplier/queue_max_wait_minutes；smtp_settings 的 update 可改 host/port/encryption/username/from_address/from_name/enabled，test 需 to；storage 的 update 可改 name/account_id/region/endpoint/bucket/path_prefix/addressing/use_ssl/public_base_url/signed_ttl_sec/direct_upload，或 action=check/default/delete；image_processor 的 config 字段为 domain/width/format/time_sec/quality/on_error_redirect/media_enabled，create 需 name/vendor/storage_id/config，update 可改 name/config，或 action=check/publish/rollback/disable/delete。图片服务先 presets 再创建，创建用稳定 key，无需摘要；其他管理操作必须先 admin_get_resource 取得 base_sha256。密码、密钥、新建存储必须到专用表单操作，禁止放进 patch。管理操作不支持自动回滚。JSON Merge Patch；model 仅允许 pricing/capabilities/label/hint/tags/enabled。plugin 的 patch={code:源码}，必须先 admin_plugin_check；channel 的 patch={name,base_url,headers?,rate_limit?,enabled?}，不能含密钥；model_create 的 patch=完整 ModelConfig，强制 enabled=false，协议 version 可填 latest。创建目标必须给稳定 key；更新 model/pricing_settings 必须给 base_sha256。"
            },
            "depends_on": { "type":"array", "items":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}, "description":"依赖的本单条目下标，必须先应用；可将插件、渠道、模型放在同一单" },
            "pricing_basis": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "path",
                  "mode",
                  "price"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "path": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "售价字段路径，推荐点号 + 方括号，如 pricing.per_second、pricing.tiers[0].unit；也接受 JSON Pointer，如 /pricing/per_second、/pricing/tiers/0/unit。平台统一输出点号 + 方括号格式。"
                  },
                  "mode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "cost",
                      "relative"
                    ]
                  },
                  "upstream": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "amount",
                      "currency",
                      "unit",
                      "source_url"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "amount": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "currency": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "USD",
                          "CNY"
                        ]
                      },
                      "unit": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "source_url": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "note": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "markup_pct": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "from": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "pct": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "price": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
},
